{"id":"34d2157a44d015cc","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-comb7-cofinal-chain-family.md","title":"ZFC Comb7 Cofinal Chain Family","display":"df-zfc-comb7-cofinal-chain-family — ZFC Comb7 Cofinal Chain Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb7-cofinal-chain-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb7-cofinal-chain-family"],"display":"df-zfc-comb7-cofinal-chain-family — ZFC Comb7 Cofinal Chain Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-chain]]","[[58-df-cofinal]]","[[58-df-family]]","[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb7-cofinal-chain-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb7-cofinal-chain-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb7-cofinal-chain-family — ZFC Comb7 Cofinal Chain Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"58-df-chain\">58-df-chain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c8f804f98505ae8\" href=\"?note=6c8f804f98505ae8\" title=\"58-df-cofinal\">58-df-cofinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"545b51e7aa011030\" href=\"?note=545b51e7aa011030\" title=\"58-df-family\">58-df-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (ordered set carrier)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\">\\(\\leq_P\\)</span> (order relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq P\">\\(C\\subseteq P\\)</span> (candidate chain family)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Chain}\">\\(\\operatorname{Chain}\\)</span> (chain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"58-df-chain\">58-df-chain</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb7CofinalChainFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb7CofinalChainFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chain}\">\\(\\mathrm{Chain}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"58-df-chain\">58-df-chain</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}chain\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7CofinalChainFamily}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land \\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(p\\leq_P c)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}chain\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7CofinalChainFamily}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land \\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(p\\leq_P c)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary order-combinatorial definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-chain","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinal","status":"resolved","id":"6c8f804f98505ae8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"545b51e7aa011030","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-chain","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Chain}$ (chain predicate, see [[58-df-chain]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-partial-order]])","embed